    "body": "I confirmed we can land this and that it won't conflict with spec-factory. I also took some time to compare this to existing agenda issues. I noticed this is lacking the following things which we probably want to include:\n\n- Missing a placeholder link to the previous agenda issue. We always link the previous week and I think we should continue to do so.\n- I think we should continue to include \"Note that this is 1 week later in the AMER-EMEA friendly time\" (and vice versa).\n- This only calls out the editors as a point of contact and not the person chairing. Maybe instead we should direct people to https://whatwg.org/chat if they need anything?",
